{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 4, "text": "第一节 布依语的系属", "bbox_px": {"x": 563, "y": 817, "w": 579, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "第一节 布依语的系属", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 563, "y": 817, "w": 579, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 5, "text": "布依语与壮语、傣语国际上习惯称为“台语”。但有时“台语”也泛指我国境内的壮", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 982, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依语与壮语、傣语国际上习惯称为“台语”。但有时“台语”也泛指我国境内的壮", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 982, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 6, "text": "语、布依语、傣语、侗语、水语、毛南语、仡佬语、拉珈语、仡佬语和临高话、莫话及国外的泰", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1046, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "语、布依语、傣语、侗语、水语、毛南语、仡佬语、拉珈语、仡佬语和临高话、莫话及国外的泰", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1046, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 7, "text": "语、老挝语、掸语等。这些语言之间的语音系统和语法结构基本相同，有相当多的数量", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1110, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "语、老挝语、掸语等。这些语言之间的语音系统和语法结构基本相同，有相当多的数量", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1110, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 8, "text": "词。所以学术界一般是把它们作为一个语族来看待的，称为壮侗语族或侗泰语族、侗台", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1175, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "词。所以学术界一般是把它们作为一个语族来看待的，称为壮侗语族或侗泰语族、侗台", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1175, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 9, "text": "语族。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1243, "w": 113, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "语族。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1243, "w": 113, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 10, "text": "根据国内大多数学者的意见，布依语属汉藏语系。主要依据是：", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1308, "w": 1106, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "根据国内大多数学者的意见，布依语属汉藏语系。主要依据是：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1308, "w": 1106, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 11, "text": "首先，壮侗语与汉语一样，有声调，量词丰富，以词序和虚词为语法手段，词序较固", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1372, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "首先，壮侗语与汉语一样，有声调，量词丰富，以词序和虚词为语法手段，词序较固", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1372, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 12, "text": "定，没有形态的变化。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1440, "w": 370, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "定，没有形态的变化。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1440, "w": 370, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 13, "text": "其次，有大量的同源词。", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1501, "w": 418, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "其次，有大量的同源词。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1501, "w": 418, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 14, "text": "总之，布依语与壮侗语族的其他语言一样，属于汉藏语系中的一种语言。而在壮侗", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1565, "w": 1459, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "总之，布依语与壮侗语族的其他语言一样，属于汉藏语系中的一种语言。而在壮侗", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1565, "w": 1459, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 15, "text": "语族中，布依语与同属壮傣语支的壮语、傣语（特别是壮语）有着更 接近的亲缘关系。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1629, "w": 1552, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "语族中，布依语与同属壮傣语支的壮语、傣语（特别是壮语）有着更 接近的亲缘关系。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1629, "w": 1552, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 16, "text": "布依语与壮语北部方言基本相同。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1694, "w": 603, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依语与壮语北部方言基本相同。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1694, "w": 603, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 17, "text": "第二节 布依语的演变与发展", "bbox_px": {"x": 486, "y": 1851, "w": 752, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "第二节 布依语的演变与发展", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 486, "y": 1851, "w": 752, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 18, "text": "壮侗语族各种语言是从原始台语发展演变而来的。从原始台语发展到今天的壮侗", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 2024, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "壮侗语族各种语言是从原始台语发展演变而来的。从原始台语发展到今天的壮侗", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 2024, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 19, "text": "语族及其若干语支中各种语言，各种语言又发展为各种方言土语，勾画出了一种语言发", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2088, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "语族及其若干语支中各种语言，各种语言又发展为各种方言土语，勾画出了一种语言发", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2088, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 20, "text": "展演变的历史轨迹。布依语分为三个土语，就是布依语在历史发展过程中，一些地区性", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 2152, "w": 1536, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "展演变的历史轨迹。布依语分为三个土语，就是布依语在历史发展过程中，一些地区性", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 2152, "w": 1536, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 21, "text": "差异逐步扩大，并创造了新的成分或吸收了一些外来语成分而形成的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 2213, "w": 1230, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "差异逐步扩大，并创造了新的成分或吸收了一些外来语成分而形成的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 2213, "w": 1230, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 76, "line_no": 22, "text": "但是，由于布依族历史上没有产生与母语相一致的文字符号，所以没有相应的文献", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2277, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "但是，由于布依族历史上没有产生与母语相一致的文字符号，所以没有相应的文献", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2277, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
